{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117705","id":3428626257,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7MXK9R","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117705","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117705.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117705.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117705","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117705/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117705/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117705/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/0843cb82a758d259612900488894f67e4e54c706","number":117705,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Deprecate `Input.should_ignore_device()`","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR deprecates `Input.should_ignore_device()` method. For context, it was added in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/76045 .\r\n- If a developer wants to ignore non-controller devices (or other devices that should be ignored) in their game, it should already be handled by the engine, or if an unnecessary device still gets detected, it should be considered a bug in the engine;\r\n- If a game wants to detect if Steam is running (by checking if their connected controller's vendor/product ID is ignored, I assume?), there are better tools to do this job;\r\n- This method only works with `SDL_GAMECONTROLLER_IGNORE_DEVICES` environment variable and it doesn't detect other types of devices that should be ignored:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/65e73b3a5eec19e3269809b0f00e73a646723067/thirdparty/sdl/joystick/SDL_gamepad.c#L169-L196\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/65e73b3a5eec19e3269809b0f00e73a646723067/thirdparty/sdl/joystick/SDL_joystick.c#L169-L284\r\n- And this method isn't used internally by the engine anymore, SDL and other joypad backends (Android) already handle ignored devices for us.\r\n\r\nPlease let me know if I missed an important use case of this method in my description. 😅 ","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermin